Package: dsh-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20.12), npm, pnpm, curl, ca-certificates, jq, procps, iproute2
Recommends: electron | brave-browser | google-chrome-stable | chromium-browser | chromium
Maintainer: businessgaberino-commits <business.gaberino@gmail.com>
Description: Native desktop launcher for DeepSeek Harness
 Wraps the official @deepseek-ai/dsh runtime in a dedicated,
 sandboxed Electron desktop application window. Ships a systemd
 user service, initializes the default profile, links prebuilt
 sharp binaries for linux-x64, and launches Node with the
 --expose-internals flag required by the cordis HMR plugin
 (bypassing the NODE_OPTIONS restriction).
